WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:38.560
If I feared death,

01:39.640 --> 01:40.920
I wouldn't be standing here now.

01:45.480 --> 01:47.360
Between killing Hao Tian
and being controlled by him,

01:47.960 --> 01:49.520
I choose the former.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.320
Let's begin.

01:57.480 --> 02:00.360
THOUSANDS OF YEARS AGO, DONGZE PALACE

02:01.480 --> 02:02.600
Zhao Ming.

02:15.720 --> 02:17.760
TWILIGHT SPIRIT PAVILION

02:17.840 --> 02:19.000
So,

02:20.400 --> 02:22.920
Zhao Ming will ascend alone
to slay deities,

02:24.200 --> 02:26.400
bearing the suffering for 10,000 years.

02:27.640 --> 02:28.800
If only…

02:29.840 --> 02:32.600
If I had helped him
fight the deities sooner,

02:33.400 --> 02:35.840
could this tragedy have been avoided?

02:36.360 --> 02:39.400
The cause and effect of history
has already unfolded.

02:39.920 --> 02:41.360
It cannot be undone.

02:42.440 --> 02:45.080
History's course must not be altered.

02:45.600 --> 02:46.880
Otherwise,

02:46.960 --> 02:50.440
the world that follows will collapse.

02:50.520 --> 02:53.680
Upon Hao Tian's descent,
everything will be unknown.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.720
If all goes well,

02:56.640 --> 02:59.840
we can save ourselves
after killing Hao Tian.

03:00.880 --> 03:04.080
Or perhaps, we will save the world,

03:05.680 --> 03:07.560
only to perish with Hao Tian.

03:08.480 --> 03:10.680
Protecting all beings
has always been my duty.

03:11.440 --> 03:14.600
This life of mine no longer belongs to me.

03:14.680 --> 03:18.080
This game is about the entire world.
Failure is not an option.

03:19.080 --> 03:22.000
Remember, before Zhao Ming
ascends to slay deities,

03:22.680 --> 03:25.360
make sure Hao Tian possesses Zhao Ming.

03:25.960 --> 03:27.360
Only in this way

03:27.440 --> 03:30.280
can we create Hao Tian's form in your time

03:30.960 --> 03:33.520
and bring about
the mutual killing of two Hao Tians.

03:33.600 --> 03:37.680
At that time, you must help him
complete the final step.

03:39.360 --> 03:42.840
Hao Tian does not suspect me yet.
It won't be hard to act.

03:42.920 --> 03:44.280
But I'm worried about you.

03:44.880 --> 03:46.720
Hao Tian has already
noticed your betrayal,

03:46.800 --> 03:48.000
so you must be more careful.

03:48.080 --> 03:50.800
Now that you know everything
in the following 10,000 years,

03:52.800 --> 03:53.640
do you regret it?

03:56.480 --> 03:57.800
What about you?

03:59.840 --> 04:02.080
After enduring 10,000 years of pain,

04:02.800 --> 04:04.960
why are you still willing
to risk it all for the world?

04:08.360 --> 04:09.920
After my fate changed,

04:10.800 --> 04:12.040
dark thoughts began to arise.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.880
The blood on my hands

04:17.880 --> 04:19.680
must eventually be paid back.

04:21.560 --> 04:23.160
I must restore

04:23.960 --> 04:26.520
a clean Zhao Ming
to Pearl and to this world.

04:28.000 --> 04:29.760
What more can I do?

04:29.840 --> 04:32.160
Since you already know
this farewell is inevitable,

04:32.240 --> 04:34.880
you should cherish
the last moments together.

04:35.880 --> 04:39.440
Don't leave behind
unfixable regrets like I did.

04:40.040 --> 04:41.320
I never expected

04:42.520 --> 04:45.800
that the cause of Zhao Ming, I, and Fate

04:46.640 --> 04:49.720
would make you bear this suffering
10,000 years later.

04:55.160 --> 04:56.760
I owe you an apology.

04:58.200 --> 04:59.200
No.

04:59.280 --> 05:00.360
Pearl,

05:01.080 --> 05:02.640
I should thank you.

05:03.640 --> 05:06.640
You exhausted your power,
leaving Zhao Ming's soul,

05:08.200 --> 05:09.920
so I could meet Xie Xuechen.

05:12.800 --> 05:14.440
Xie Xuechen…

05:17.400 --> 05:18.920
What kind of person is he?

05:22.080 --> 05:23.240
He…

05:25.160 --> 05:26.280
He's a good person.

05:27.360 --> 05:29.120
Is he as good as Zhao Ming?

05:39.280 --> 05:41.000
In your heart,

05:41.680 --> 05:43.240
Zhao Ming is naturally the best.

05:48.080 --> 05:48.960
But in my heart,

05:50.080 --> 05:51.640
Xie Xuechen is unique,

05:54.240 --> 05:56.000
the best person in the world.

05:57.440 --> 05:59.480
He already died to save me,

06:00.520 --> 06:02.760
and I will do everything I can

06:04.440 --> 06:06.080
to protect his world.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.200
I never thought

06:08.920 --> 06:13.600
that 10,000 years later, I would have
to resort to such desperate measures

06:13.680 --> 06:15.640
to combat the world-ending disaster.

06:19.440 --> 06:22.200
Though I've glimpsed
the cause and effect of all things,

06:23.280 --> 06:25.760
I never predicted the true ending.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.360
I once believed in fate,

06:28.440 --> 06:30.200
but now I believe even more

06:30.880 --> 06:34.480
that the true ending is in our own hands.

06:35.440 --> 06:37.280
The decision made
10,000 years ago was mine,

06:37.360 --> 06:39.520
but the pain, the suffering,
and the humiliation

06:39.600 --> 06:42.360
for 10,000 years was borne by you.

06:45.280 --> 06:46.600
During these 10,000 years,

06:48.800 --> 06:49.960
you've endured so much.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.840
From the beginning of chaos,

06:57.960 --> 07:00.080
we were controlled by Hao Tian.

07:01.280 --> 07:03.160
This battle against Hao Tian

07:03.920 --> 07:05.400
truly has an uncertain outcome.

07:07.520 --> 07:08.800
All of this

07:09.600 --> 07:11.320
shouldn't have been yours to bear.

07:13.520 --> 07:15.760
I have nothing left to lose.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.600
Moreover,

07:18.120 --> 07:20.960
this is the only way to protect the world.

07:22.280 --> 07:23.640
No matter what,

07:24.600 --> 07:26.000
I will give my all.

07:27.160 --> 07:29.640
To protect the world we swore to defend,

07:30.600 --> 07:32.880
I will follow the established course,

07:33.760 --> 07:34.720
every step as planned.

07:37.400 --> 07:40.360
After 10,000 years of rebirth,
enduring the emotional curse

07:41.400 --> 07:42.960
and meeting the old friend again,

07:44.280 --> 07:45.920
have you ever realized

07:47.200 --> 07:49.040
what love really is?

07:49.640 --> 07:50.920
Love…

07:57.080 --> 07:58.680
Love cannot be comprehended.

08:03.440 --> 08:05.040
Bound for 10,000 years,

08:06.760 --> 08:08.480
yet love remains beyond understanding.

08:09.920 --> 08:11.240
As I thought,

08:12.240 --> 08:16.480
though we control fate,
we are destined to live without love.

08:17.840 --> 08:19.520
Love has no fixed definition.

08:20.040 --> 08:21.640
It arises from the heart.

08:23.440 --> 08:24.720
Sometimes,

08:25.240 --> 08:26.200
love is obsession,

08:27.360 --> 08:28.360
is to take hold,

08:29.200 --> 08:30.680
and sometimes,

08:31.600 --> 08:33.240
love is release,

08:33.919 --> 08:35.080
is letting go.

08:36.520 --> 08:37.400
Letting go?

08:42.679 --> 08:44.560
After 10,000 years,

08:45.440 --> 08:47.280
having experienced the mortal world,

08:49.400 --> 08:51.640
now I seem to believe

08:52.160 --> 08:53.360
that humans

08:54.920 --> 08:55.920
can defy fate.

09:14.560 --> 09:15.400
Hao Tian,

09:16.120 --> 09:19.080
in this world, there is only
endless ignorance and slaughter.

09:19.160 --> 09:23.720
I humbly invite Your Grace to possess
my body to destroy this broken world

09:24.480 --> 09:26.280
and create a new era.

09:26.360 --> 09:28.960
The world is decaying,
and human nature is cold and indifferent.

09:29.040 --> 09:32.400
In this life, guarding the world
is all a misdirected sacrifice.

09:34.480 --> 09:36.200
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

09:36.280 --> 09:38.120
I, Zhao Ming,
am willing to assist Your Grace.

09:38.760 --> 09:40.840
I humbly invite Your Grace to possess me.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.960
The Timekeeper stabilizes time and space,

10:22.480 --> 10:25.000
and the Fatekeeper
stabilizes cause and effect.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.560
Now is the time for us to work together.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.280
Are you ready?

10:34.960 --> 10:36.440
No need to prepare.

10:36.520 --> 10:38.080
Since the beginning of chaos,

10:38.160 --> 10:39.760
we have already been cooperating
for tens of thousands of years.

11:10.360 --> 11:12.920
Beginning is the end.

11:13.440 --> 11:16.520
The starting point
is also the ending point.

11:16.600 --> 11:19.080
The beginning and end are intertwined,
repeating endlessly.

11:19.160 --> 11:23.360
The chance of life
lies in the moment of our reunion.

11:44.440 --> 11:49.080
I never expected
that they would figure out this method.

11:49.160 --> 11:51.800
But trying to defy me with human strength

11:51.880 --> 11:54.440
is truly overestimating themselves.

11:57.640 --> 12:00.920
These arrogant ones must pay the price.

12:01.000 --> 12:04.520
Let them be forever condemned.

12:12.680 --> 12:14.720
Revered Saint Emperor,

12:14.800 --> 12:17.480
do you truly understand yourself?

12:17.560 --> 12:20.720
Though you hide your reluctance
anger, and rebellion

12:20.800 --> 12:22.280
deep in your heart,

12:22.360 --> 12:24.280
do you think they do not exist?

12:24.800 --> 12:25.800
No,

12:25.880 --> 12:28.520
the Demon Lord is the best proof.

12:28.600 --> 12:31.560
He… is your dark side.

12:31.640 --> 12:35.280
Zhao Ming is the Saint Emperor,
loved by the masses,

12:35.360 --> 12:39.320
and you are the fallen demon
of the Dark Abyss, despised by the world.

12:39.400 --> 12:43.560
You are Zhao Ming's shame,
the burden he most wishes to abandon.

12:44.080 --> 12:48.480
What the world needs is the Saint Emperor,
not the Demon Lord.

12:49.440 --> 12:51.840
Everyone calls you noble and selfless,

12:51.920 --> 12:55.320
but when the ministers betray,
and the people turn away,

12:55.400 --> 12:58.080
you truly feel no hatred?

12:58.160 --> 13:00.960
When you separated from Pearl
to save the world,

13:01.040 --> 13:03.560
you truly feel no regret?

13:04.080 --> 13:07.040
You feel anger, obsession, and regret.

13:07.120 --> 13:11.400
It's simply impossible
for you to remain pure forever.

13:11.480 --> 13:13.640
Pearl awaited Zhao Ming,

13:13.720 --> 13:16.320
Mu Xuanling awaited Xie Xuechen,

13:16.400 --> 13:19.320
and you, the fallen Demon Lord,

13:19.400 --> 13:21.840
with no loved ones, no friends,

13:21.920 --> 13:25.160
only seen as Zhao Ming's dark thoughts.

13:25.240 --> 13:28.800
Your existence is utterly meaningless!

13:33.920 --> 13:35.360
Zhao Ming's heart is clear,

13:35.880 --> 13:37.680
and the Demon Lord's heart
has been released.

13:37.760 --> 13:39.320
How could they still
be deceived by Hao Tian?

13:39.920 --> 13:42.200
There is no one in this world
without inner demons.

13:42.920 --> 13:45.040
As long as there is desire in the heart,

13:45.120 --> 13:47.920
something to cling to,
something to yearn for,

13:48.000 --> 13:49.800
Hao Tian will find the flaw.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.160
If this continues,

13:52.680 --> 13:54.440
the incense will burn out soon.

13:55.280 --> 13:57.080
This is exactly Hao Tian's plan.

13:57.680 --> 14:00.200
Once this incense burns out,

14:00.280 --> 14:03.320
the two Hao Tians
will return to their respective timelines

14:03.400 --> 14:05.040
and once again rule the world.

14:05.120 --> 14:07.120
We cannot let Hao Tian succeed.

14:07.640 --> 14:09.200
We must find a way to awaken them quickly.

14:09.800 --> 14:12.120
The rule-free zone
lies beyond our time and space.

14:12.960 --> 14:15.040
We can't intervene.

14:19.360 --> 14:21.120
The incense time is almost up.

14:21.640 --> 14:24.600
If we can't kill Hao Tian now,
the world will be destroyed.

14:25.120 --> 14:27.280
Nan Xuyue, I have a plan.

14:27.360 --> 14:30.720
My true form is the Timekeeper artifact,
not bound by time and space.

14:31.320 --> 14:33.200
I will give you all the power of Chaos.

14:33.720 --> 14:35.120
You must stabilize time and space here,

14:35.800 --> 14:39.160
send my true form into the rule-free zone,

14:39.240 --> 14:40.960
and help them fight Hao Tians.

14:41.600 --> 14:42.680
No!

14:43.520 --> 14:46.960
Your true form will perish
with the collapse of the rule-free zone.

14:50.080 --> 14:52.800
-It's better to follow my plan.
-What is it?

14:56.720 --> 14:58.200
The artifact's destruction

14:58.800 --> 15:01.320
will cause a brief change
in time and space.

15:01.840 --> 15:05.320
The passage
to the rule-free zone will reopen.

15:07.480 --> 15:08.600
At that time,

15:10.520 --> 15:14.760
you can send your and Pearl's mind
into the rule-free zone,

15:14.840 --> 15:15.680
while your true form

15:16.760 --> 15:18.600
stays here,

15:19.680 --> 15:20.880
stabilizing time and space.

15:26.800 --> 15:28.760
The artifact's destruction…

15:31.480 --> 15:32.840
What will you do?

15:38.760 --> 15:40.400
You're burning your true form…

15:40.480 --> 15:42.120
You will die!

15:42.920 --> 15:44.680
Let's think of another way!

15:49.960 --> 15:51.400
I once thought

15:52.320 --> 15:54.120
that as ancient artifacts,

15:55.480 --> 15:58.560
our duty was to uphold Hao Tian's order.

15:59.960 --> 16:02.160
The survival of this world

16:02.720 --> 16:04.240
has nothing to do with us.

16:05.480 --> 16:07.640
Until I followed you to the mortal realm,

16:08.160 --> 16:10.280
experienced the human life,

16:11.240 --> 16:14.440
and felt a hint of warmth

16:15.120 --> 16:16.600
and desire,

16:17.120 --> 16:19.400
I began to hesitate.

16:22.280 --> 16:24.520
Perhaps the rules of this world

16:25.040 --> 16:26.800
can be set by Hao Tian,

16:27.480 --> 16:30.080
but the most precious love
in the human heart

16:31.040 --> 16:33.400
is something even heaven cannot control.

16:34.560 --> 16:35.840
I also know very well

16:36.360 --> 16:38.880
I no longer wish to be Hao Tian's pawn,

16:38.960 --> 16:41.120
nor do I wish to see you

16:42.960 --> 16:44.560
and this world

16:45.320 --> 16:47.080
be destroyed together.

16:52.760 --> 16:54.440
-Nan Xuyue!
-Mu Xuanling,

16:56.560 --> 16:58.160
the you I know

16:59.160 --> 17:00.920
has never been hesitant.

17:02.240 --> 17:05.920
You've always known
what the best choice was.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.280
And now,

17:09.400 --> 17:10.880
you should be the same.

17:31.360 --> 17:33.520
Meeting you for the first time

17:36.640 --> 17:39.000
felt like greeting an old friend.

17:42.240 --> 17:44.920
Under a distant, renewed moon,

17:46.160 --> 17:47.160
you are my…

17:49.360 --> 17:50.680
dawn-to-dusk longing.

17:53.840 --> 17:55.120
You promised…

17:59.200 --> 18:01.320
to give me a little bit of liking.

18:02.400 --> 18:03.920
I can give you what you want,

18:04.760 --> 18:05.800
including…

18:06.720 --> 18:07.880
that little bit of liking.

18:26.360 --> 18:27.400
Mu Xuanling,

18:28.840 --> 18:31.080
go and fulfill your desires.

18:37.320 --> 18:38.640
Nan Xuyue…

18:53.240 --> 18:54.800
Through these 10,000 years…

18:56.160 --> 18:58.760
you've never lived a day for yourself.

19:02.400 --> 19:04.480
Now, you're finally free.

19:07.760 --> 19:09.000
Nan Xuyue,

19:11.160 --> 19:13.160
you sacrificed yourself
to fulfill all this.

19:18.320 --> 19:20.280
I will not let you down.

19:29.120 --> 19:30.520
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

19:59.800 --> 20:02.080
Wake up. Don't be deceived by Hao Tian.

20:02.920 --> 20:04.960
Zhao Ming, don't be deceived by him.

20:05.560 --> 20:07.800
Everything in this world has its opposite,

20:07.880 --> 20:11.280
just like love and hate,
right and wrong, black and white.

20:12.000 --> 20:13.480
When sunlight shines on someone,
shadows are cast.

20:13.560 --> 20:15.400
You already know the truth.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.840
Whether in the past

20:17.920 --> 20:19.280
or in the present,

20:19.360 --> 20:20.920
we have never betrayed you.

20:21.000 --> 20:24.200
But the fault lies neither
with the sunlight nor with the shadow,

20:24.280 --> 20:25.680
nor with you, who stand in its light!

20:31.480 --> 20:33.200
Listen, how deceitful she is.

20:34.400 --> 20:36.240
She loves the Beacon of Righteousness,

20:36.320 --> 20:38.200
Xie Xuechen.

20:38.720 --> 20:40.040
She's here now to help you,

20:40.800 --> 20:42.560
but only to bring Xie Xuechen back.

20:43.200 --> 20:44.280
What does that have to do with you?

20:53.160 --> 20:54.920
See how she pretends?

20:55.680 --> 20:57.800
She is an ancient artifact.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.600
She has been on the Celestial Altar
for tens of thousands of years,

20:59.680 --> 21:02.840
observing countless lives and deaths,
good and evil.

21:04.920 --> 21:07.520
In fact, being emotionless
is her true nature.

21:08.480 --> 21:10.040
The rules are her fate.

21:10.120 --> 21:14.160
You two are destined to be
on different paths.

21:20.400 --> 21:21.720
You and I

21:21.800 --> 21:24.080
are the ones
who understand each other the most.

21:24.160 --> 21:27.680
We have no family,
and we've both lost our loved ones.

21:27.760 --> 21:30.480
Though I have Pearl's memories,
I am not her.

21:30.560 --> 21:33.480
You also have Xie Xuechen's memories,
but you are not him.

21:33.560 --> 21:36.200
I understand you,
just as I understand myself.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.240
Understanding?

21:40.320 --> 21:42.160
You've always been wrong!

21:42.680 --> 21:44.040
As the ruler,

21:44.120 --> 21:46.200
you've disregarded life for 10,000 years,
slaughtering the world.

21:46.800 --> 21:48.600
What is the difference
between your actions and those of demons?

21:49.440 --> 21:52.600
If Hao Tian is unkind
and deities are heartless,

21:54.000 --> 21:55.920
then this world doesn't need you!

21:56.000 --> 21:57.320
It doesn't need us?

21:58.600 --> 22:00.000
Think carefully.

22:00.920 --> 22:03.880
The human race
you once protected betrayed you.

22:03.960 --> 22:06.120
Even the Chaos Pearl,
nurtured with blood essence by you,

22:06.200 --> 22:07.960
eventually betrayed you, didn't it?

22:08.040 --> 22:09.720
It was she

22:10.560 --> 22:13.000
who pushed you into the deepest abyss.

22:13.520 --> 22:15.440
What's left to trust in her?

22:16.040 --> 22:17.520
Ten thousand years ago,

22:18.160 --> 22:19.960
you were suppressed by Fate,

22:20.040 --> 22:22.720
falling from a revered
Saint Emperor into a Fallen Deity.

22:24.160 --> 22:26.840
Who ever gave you the chance to choose?

22:32.960 --> 22:34.280
Zhao Ming,

22:34.360 --> 22:38.240
whether to do good or evil,
the choice has always been yours.

22:39.200 --> 22:40.960
You must know all this better than I do.

22:41.600 --> 22:44.960
We've come here today,
no matter the cost, not for ourselves.

22:45.040 --> 22:47.720
Just now, to bring me and Pearl in,

22:47.800 --> 22:49.440
Nan Xuyue has already fallen.

22:49.520 --> 22:51.000
Wake up,

22:51.520 --> 22:54.520
otherwise all the sacrifices and efforts
will have been in vain.

22:54.600 --> 22:57.000
I fell to the mortal realm
after repairing the heavens.

22:58.280 --> 22:59.960
You warmed the heart of that pearl.

23:01.080 --> 23:04.800
You taught that pearl… what love is.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.960
Now, I've regained my memory and power.

23:09.040 --> 23:10.520
This time,

23:12.200 --> 23:13.640
let me stand by your side

23:14.720 --> 23:17.280
and break all these unjust rules

23:18.800 --> 23:19.920
of Hao Tian.

23:20.000 --> 23:22.760
You once asked me for the power of Chaos.

23:23.520 --> 23:24.600
I refused to give it to you

23:25.880 --> 23:27.200
because I hope

23:27.720 --> 23:29.400
that you can see who you really are first.

23:30.160 --> 23:31.720
Now,

23:32.760 --> 23:33.880
I, Mu Xuanling,

23:35.040 --> 23:37.040
am willing to use the power of Chaos

23:37.120 --> 23:41.040
to help you break through the universe
and recreate the heavens and earth.

24:32.880 --> 24:35.000
After the strongest clash,

24:35.920 --> 24:39.640
both Hao Tians have been completely gone.

24:44.080 --> 24:45.160
Then,

24:46.600 --> 24:47.880
what will our ending be?

24:50.960 --> 24:52.560
No matter the outcome,

24:53.080 --> 24:55.840
if one of you survives,
the Demon Lord or Zhao Ming,

24:55.920 --> 24:57.760
you must return to the time
of 10,000 years ago

24:57.840 --> 25:01.640
and follow the original course
to walk history again

25:02.680 --> 25:05.600
to preserve the future.
This method has never been tried before.

25:05.680 --> 25:07.960
Everything must be decided
according to the situation.

25:09.040 --> 25:12.080
Does Xie Xuechen's soul…
truly not exist anymore?

25:12.680 --> 25:13.840
I'll say this once more.

25:14.480 --> 25:17.200
Xie Xuechen's soul
has been completely integrated by me.

25:18.360 --> 25:19.880
Have you ever considered

25:19.960 --> 25:24.280
that with Xie Xuechen's soul fragment,
your power may surpass Zhao Ming's?

25:25.080 --> 25:27.320
If your fight ends in life or death,

25:28.080 --> 25:29.560
the one who survives…

25:30.520 --> 25:31.640
may very well be you.

25:34.960 --> 25:38.720
Hao Tian is dead.
The world-ending crisis has been solved.

25:39.280 --> 25:41.320
The world has been saved.

25:43.120 --> 25:44.600
I die without regret.

25:45.560 --> 25:48.120
But the established
cause and effect already exist

25:48.640 --> 25:50.040
and cannot be changed.

25:50.560 --> 25:51.560
Future generations of people,

25:51.640 --> 25:54.240
events, and objects

25:54.760 --> 25:57.440
are all derived and inherited
from 10,000 years ago.

25:58.320 --> 26:00.920
The major historical course back then

26:01.000 --> 26:03.360
must not shift.

26:03.880 --> 26:07.440
Otherwise,
the entire future will collapse.

26:08.360 --> 26:09.880
The incense has burned out.

26:10.720 --> 26:13.920
With the restoration of time and space,
you'll return to 10,000 years ago.

26:14.880 --> 26:17.280
Whether to walk the old path again,

26:17.360 --> 26:21.000
this time, the final choice is yours.

27:14.560 --> 27:15.560
Zhao Ming.

27:22.400 --> 27:24.640
Pearl awaits Zhao Ming,

27:24.720 --> 27:27.200
Mu Xuanling waits for Xie Xuechen,

27:27.280 --> 27:30.200
and you, the fallen Demon Lord,

27:30.280 --> 27:32.840
with no loved ones, no friends,

27:32.920 --> 27:36.120
only seen as Zhao Ming's dark thoughts.

27:36.200 --> 27:40.120
Your existence is utterly meaningless!

27:40.200 --> 27:41.040
You're back.

27:44.920 --> 27:47.000
I'm not the one you were waiting for.

27:55.360 --> 27:56.520
Let me ask you.

27:57.880 --> 27:59.760
Was it you who nurtured me

28:00.960 --> 28:01.920
with your blood essence?

28:03.480 --> 28:05.680
Was it you who taught me to be human?

28:07.880 --> 28:08.920
Was it you

28:09.840 --> 28:11.160
who gave me candy?

28:13.720 --> 28:15.440
Was it you…

28:17.080 --> 28:18.200
who swapped the marriage agreement?

28:21.720 --> 28:24.080
Was it you who left me alone

28:25.920 --> 28:27.400
in this world?

28:29.880 --> 28:31.760
Whether the world recognizes you or not,

28:33.120 --> 28:34.200
I recognize you.

28:47.520 --> 28:48.600
Zhao Ming,

28:50.120 --> 28:51.560
through these 10,000 years,

28:53.080 --> 28:55.200
you must have suffered greatly.

29:25.920 --> 29:28.160
But I'm no longer
the Zhao Ming of the past.

29:29.120 --> 29:30.680
I'm now consumed by dark thoughts.

29:37.120 --> 29:38.320
What if…

29:40.840 --> 29:43.120
What if I don't wish
to walk the old path again

29:43.640 --> 29:45.080
and only want to stay by your side?

29:48.640 --> 29:49.920
Then, I'll follow your will.

29:51.560 --> 29:54.320
In that case, I will be
a dishonorable scoundrel for once.

29:55.360 --> 29:57.400
Mu Xuanling and Xie Xuechen

29:58.040 --> 29:59.840
will never reunite.

30:06.160 --> 30:07.840
Let us take their place

30:08.600 --> 30:10.440
to see all the great mountains and rivers,

30:11.040 --> 30:12.200
to witness this world together.

30:13.000 --> 30:14.320
Even if we are scorned by all beings?

30:14.920 --> 30:17.480
We are so powerful.
Who would dare insult us?

30:18.280 --> 30:19.480
Besides,

30:20.360 --> 30:23.000
wouldn't being a foolish emperor
and a demon empress

30:24.920 --> 30:26.200
be quite wonderful too?

30:28.520 --> 30:30.360
Even if the future world is destroyed?

30:32.120 --> 30:34.560
I've never seen the future world anyway.

30:36.440 --> 30:38.000
All I can see

30:39.200 --> 30:40.800
is you right in front of me.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.600
You little pearl,

30:50.680 --> 30:52.600
still great at cheering people up.

30:55.080 --> 30:57.760
But you don't need
to comfort me with false words.

30:58.560 --> 30:59.520
Zhao Ming,

31:01.240 --> 31:05.040
you've endured 10,000 years
of torment and misunderstanding.

31:06.480 --> 31:07.840
If it were possible,

31:09.640 --> 31:12.320
I truly hope you could follow
your heart and nature.

31:14.320 --> 31:15.640
But I know,

31:16.960 --> 31:20.360
whether 10,000 years ago
or 10,000 years later,

31:21.320 --> 31:24.280
you always place the people and your duty

31:25.480 --> 31:27.960
above your own life and honor.

31:31.880 --> 31:32.960
Zhao Ming,

31:34.280 --> 31:35.600
I trust your choice.

31:37.640 --> 31:39.280
Whatever your decision is,

31:41.280 --> 31:42.800
whether life or death,

31:44.000 --> 31:45.920
I will walk alongside you.

31:48.360 --> 31:51.120
So, this time,

31:53.080 --> 31:55.080
do not abandon me again.

31:56.360 --> 31:57.480
Alright?

32:17.640 --> 32:19.440
But I don't want you

32:21.840 --> 32:24.040
to become someone
consumed by 10,000 years of hatred.

32:28.840 --> 32:30.120
Time is running out.

32:30.720 --> 32:32.160
It's time for my leaving.

32:52.600 --> 32:54.040
I will listen to you,

32:56.880 --> 32:58.080
follow my heart,

32:59.520 --> 33:00.760
and follow my nature.

33:02.640 --> 33:03.720
Let us…

33:05.520 --> 33:06.600
say goodbye here.

33:31.400 --> 33:32.320
Alright.

34:49.000 --> 34:51.040
The decision made
10,000 years ago was mine,

34:51.120 --> 34:53.719
but the suffering, the pain,
and the humiliation for 10,000 years

34:53.800 --> 34:55.320
was borne by you.

34:55.840 --> 34:57.120
During these 10,000 years,

34:59.200 --> 35:00.560
you've endured so much.

35:01.160 --> 35:02.920
What you've been through,
I've experienced.

35:03.800 --> 35:05.320
What you haven't been through,
I've also endured.

35:06.080 --> 35:08.200
Facing trials one after another,
step by step,

35:08.280 --> 35:10.600
I realized I still have attachments

35:11.400 --> 35:13.000
to this world.

35:14.800 --> 35:17.600
As for the next decision, let me make it.

35:19.160 --> 35:21.960
Today, I want only the sun and moon
to exist in this world,

35:22.040 --> 35:23.520
no more deities.

35:35.800 --> 35:38.320
Without deities' permission, how dare you…

35:39.880 --> 35:40.640
Enough nonsense.

35:55.200 --> 35:57.520
We plead for Your Grace
to imprison the evil emperor,

35:57.600 --> 35:59.440
so he can never emerge again.

35:59.520 --> 36:02.240
Erase this figure from humanity!

36:07.120 --> 36:08.640
After 10,000 years,

36:10.040 --> 36:11.440
there's one question
I've always wanted to ask you.

36:15.400 --> 36:17.200
If Hao Tian had not existed back then,

36:18.640 --> 36:20.200
would you have chosen

36:21.360 --> 36:22.520
to imprison me in the Lava?

36:26.520 --> 36:28.400
Fate allows no "what ifs".

36:29.480 --> 36:30.720
This question

36:33.080 --> 36:33.920
has no answer.

36:37.040 --> 36:38.040
Fine.

36:38.960 --> 36:40.040
Let's begin.

36:41.360 --> 36:42.360
Do you regret it?

36:43.320 --> 36:44.400
No regrets.

36:54.120 --> 36:56.200
Evil Emperor Zhao Ming

36:56.280 --> 36:58.200
defied heaven to destroy deities,

36:58.280 --> 36:59.640
descended into a demon,

37:02.000 --> 37:03.440
and was imprisoned in the Lava.

37:04.560 --> 37:06.720
Since I still have
attachments to this world,

37:07.880 --> 37:09.480
let me guard it once more.

37:11.800 --> 37:13.040
Even if I become a demon,

37:13.880 --> 37:14.720
I will have no regrets.

37:15.720 --> 37:19.120
Evil Emperor Zhao Ming,
for selfish desires,

37:19.200 --> 37:22.680
defied heaven to slay deities
and descended into a demon.

37:22.760 --> 37:25.800
The divine artifacts joined forces
to imprison him in the Lava.

37:35.200 --> 37:36.760
You have your choice,

37:37.520 --> 37:39.080
and I have my duty to protect.

37:40.240 --> 37:41.720
No matter how difficult,

37:42.960 --> 37:44.880
I will stand by you until the end.

37:57.000 --> 38:00.320
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

38:07.800 --> 38:09.040
In the end,

38:09.640 --> 38:10.600
did he say anything?

38:11.360 --> 38:12.520
He said

38:14.000 --> 38:14.840
he has no regrets.

38:18.960 --> 38:20.400
Even after 10,000 years,

38:21.800 --> 38:23.320
he's still the same.

38:25.680 --> 38:26.640
And what about you,

38:26.720 --> 38:28.160
Fate?

38:30.200 --> 38:31.560
Will you still stop me?

38:37.760 --> 38:39.120
Can I stop you?

38:40.840 --> 38:42.920
You'll ultimately walk your own path.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.680
Then, this time,

38:56.880 --> 38:58.320
let's not fight, shall we?

39:27.640 --> 39:28.800
Zhao Ming,

39:29.680 --> 39:31.960
thank you for teaching me
what it means to be human,

39:32.960 --> 39:35.400
what love is, and what it means
to have a loving heart.

39:37.640 --> 39:39.120
From this farewell,

39:39.960 --> 39:41.680
10,000 years will pass

39:42.520 --> 39:44.120
before we meet again.

39:59.760 --> 40:01.160
From this day forward,

40:01.720 --> 40:02.960
your name shall be High Cyclic Divinity.

40:03.800 --> 40:05.760
I have bestowed upon you
the power of reversing time.

40:05.840 --> 40:07.240
You will control time.

40:09.240 --> 40:11.840
Greetings to Your Supreme Deity.

40:18.680 --> 40:19.600
Now, everything

40:20.320 --> 40:22.480
has returned to its original course.

40:23.000 --> 40:23.960
It's time for me to follow him.

40:26.480 --> 40:27.520
Fate,

40:28.680 --> 40:31.280
thanks for being my companion
for tens of thousands of years.

40:33.680 --> 40:35.480
Now that Hao Tian is gone

40:36.000 --> 40:37.560
and I'm about to fall into sleep,

40:38.800 --> 40:40.760
you should walk your own path.

40:44.080 --> 40:46.000
When we meet again after 10,000 years,

40:47.440 --> 40:49.600
I hope you will have found
your own happiness.

40:53.840 --> 40:54.680
Alright.

41:37.760 --> 41:40.320
You and I have existed
for tens of thousands of years,

41:40.400 --> 41:42.960
witnessing the passage of time,
experiencing all the joys and sorrows.

41:43.800 --> 41:46.200
I thought I controlled fate,

41:46.280 --> 41:49.480
but in the end, I too was bound by it.

41:50.920 --> 41:54.560
Does this world
truly need the Book of Fate?

41:54.640 --> 41:56.760
Should all living things

41:58.200 --> 42:00.400
be controlled by destiny?

42:01.240 --> 42:03.360
What is the true purpose

42:05.680 --> 42:07.400
of our existence?

42:19.280 --> 42:21.400
Hao Tian no longer exists,

42:23.280 --> 42:25.680
and neither should the Book of Fate.

42:29.800 --> 42:31.600
The Book of Fate is destroyed,

42:34.160 --> 42:36.080
and destiny no longer rules.

42:37.960 --> 42:39.680
All beings

42:42.400 --> 42:44.280
will control their own fates.

44:09.800 --> 44:11.120
Xie…

44:11.800 --> 44:13.000
Xuechen…

44:37.280 --> 44:40.200
Only demonic power
can make the Xuanling Tree blossom.

44:41.640 --> 44:42.840
Who are you?

45:14.000 --> 45:16.360
Didn't you say you wanted
to leave the Dark Abyss

45:16.440 --> 45:18.000
and live an ordinary life?

45:18.840 --> 45:22.840
It's because I believed you
that I brought you to the Snow City.

45:22.920 --> 45:25.880
Here, you can live
like an ordinary person,

45:26.400 --> 45:28.800
cultivate and have fun with them,

45:29.400 --> 45:30.680
without fighting or seizing,

45:31.200 --> 45:33.880
brewing poisonous wine,
or sleeping in unease.

45:34.480 --> 45:35.520
Xuanling,

45:37.760 --> 45:40.040
half a day is too short
to understand the human world.

45:41.200 --> 45:42.640
If there's a chance in the future,

45:43.400 --> 45:45.600
I'll show you the real human world.

45:54.080 --> 45:55.360
Xuanling.

46:29.360 --> 46:32.320
THE END
